
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
AccountExpires                     	N/A                 	N/A       
AuthorizationFlags                 	N/A                 	N/A       
BadPasswordCount                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Comment                            	N/A                 	N/A       
CountryCode                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Flags                              	N/A                 	N/A       
FullName                           	N/A                 	N/A       
HomeDirectory                      	N/A                 	N/A       
HomeDirectoryDrive                 	N/A                 	N/A       
LastLogoff                         	N/A                 	N/A       
LastLogon                          	N/A                 	N/A       
LogonHours                         	N/A                 	N/A       
LogonServer                        	N/A                 	N/A       
MaximumStorage                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
NumberOfLogons                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Parameters                         	N/A                 	N/A       
PasswordAge                        	N/A                 	N/A       
PasswordExpires                    	N/A                 	N/A       
PrimaryGroupId                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Privileges                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Profile                            	N/A                 	N/A       
ScriptPath                         	N/A                 	N/A       
SettingID                          	N/A                 	N/A       
UnitsPerWeek                       	N/A                 	N/A       
UserComment                        	N/A                 	N/A       
UserId                             	N/A                 	N/A       
UserType                           	N/A                 	N/A       
Workstations                       	N/A                 	N/A       

